SUMMARY:Little Pumpkins! A Baby Expo at Mountainside
DESCRIPTION:Expecting a baby is a special and transformative time. Join us for Little Pumpkins! A Baby Expo at Mountainside — an in-person event designed for expectant parents and those planning to grow their families. \nDuring this informative and fun event\, you’ll: \nLearn how to create a personalized birth plan\nDiscover the variety of prenatal classes available at our hospital\nTour our Birthing Center\nConnect with Mountainside providers & team members\nMeet local organizations offering baby-friendly products and services \nEnjoy light refreshments\, enter to win exciting prizes\, and take home special giveaways. We look forward to helping you prepare for your journey into parenthood! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
