SUMMARY:Food Tour of South Orange
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Chow Town Food Tour \nWhat do Lauryn Hill\, Paul Auster and Zach Braff have in common? They’re all from South Orange\, NJ! \nOver the last century\, this formerly sleepy farm town has bloomed into a thriving satellite community of Newark and NYC. Tour guests will enjoy this 3-hour walking tour of the vibrant village of South Orange and taste what makes this an unsung gem of NJ’s food scene. \nChow Town’s classic tour\, built for fun & flavors. Distance: about 1/2 mile. Easy walk\, mostly flat terrain\, led by an expert Chow Town guide \nHighlights\nGuests on this special adventure will explore South Orange\, a sunny little suburb that’s sitting on a gold mine of culinary talent and top-notch gastronomy.\nBring an appetite! The tour will visit four fantastic Jersey eateries\, including: \n– legendary hoagies from the birthplace of the Sloppy Joe\n-an authentic Mexican taqueria\n-small-batch\, handmade baked goods\n-a sugar high from one of the most inventive sweet shops in the state \n– a mini mural tour that will teach how to identify an accomplished local artist whose work appears frequently throughout the region\n-the surprising historical landmark behind one of the most popular\, young adult mystery novels of all time\n– and more! \nBook a ticket ASAP\, while they still last! Learn more at chowtownfoodtours.com. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/food-tour-of-south-orange/
CATEGORIES:Food
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Chow-Town-Cookies-Small-scaled.jpg
END:VEVENT
