SUMMARY:8th Annual Oktoberfest at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we celebrate our Eighth Annual Oktoberfest on Saturday\, September 26th!\nIndulge in a large variety of locally inspired craft beers\, hard seltzer cocktails\, frozen slushies\, and a wide array of non-alcoholic craft drinks\, such as MB Craft Root Beer\, White Sorrel (also known as Bissap)\, Hop Water\, and Pineapple Ginger Beer. \nExperience incredible live music all throughout the day by the following fantastic\, local bands: Crow Magnum\, Mea and Company\, Wake Up Paul\, and Lil’ Bastad! DJ PaP will be on the ones and twos getting the crowd going early on! \nEnjoy a taste of the delicious offerings available on-site all day by a local food vendor. \nDress in your German-Best Oktoberfest attire and enter the costume contest or test your strength and join the stein-holding contest! A variety of outdoor games will be available for play to ensure everyone has a wúnderbar time! \nTicket holders will receive a commemorative pin (while supplies last) and a branded wristband. VIP ticket holders will receive these\, as well as a special branded badge\, a branded souvenir mug\, and guaranteed shaded seating. All ticket holders will receive one free drink ticket to be used for an alcoholic or non-alcoholic beverage\, with happy hour pricing in effect all day long! \nPlease note – the price will go up on the day of the event. \nGet your tickets now! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/8th-annual-oktoberfest-at-montclair-brewery/
LOCATION:Montclair Brewery\, 101 Walnut Street\, Montclair\, NJ\, 07042\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Entertainment,Food,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/OKTOBERFEST-2026-social-1080-x-1080-px.png
