SUMMARY:Festival de los Andes
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the rich cultures and traditions of the Andean region at the second annual Festival de los Andes at Montclair State University! Join us on Saturday\, September 26\, from 2:00–7:00 p.m. at the Amphitheater on our campus for an afternoon of live Andean music\, traditional dance\, singing\, artists and artisans\, interactive cultural workshops\, food\, and family-friendly activities. Organized by CLaSE (Center for Latino heritage and Spanish language Excellence) and community partners\, the festival brings together the University and surrounding communities to celebrate\, learn from\, and experience the cultural diversity and living traditions of the Andes. Free and open to the public.\n¡Celebra la riqueza de las culturas y tradiciones de la región andina en la segunda edición del Festival de los Andes en Montclair State University! Acompáñanos el sábado 26 de septiembre\, de 2:00 a 7:00 p.m. en el Anfiteatro\, para disfrutar de una tarde de música andina en vivo\, danzas tradicionales\, canto\, artistas y artesanos\, talleres culturales interactivos\, comida y actividades para toda la familia. Organizado por CLaSE junto con colaboradores de la universidad y de la comunidad\, el festival reúne a nuestra comunidad universitaria y a las comunidades locales para celebrar\, conocer y compartir la diversidad cultural y las tradiciones vivas de los Andes. El evento es gratuito y abierto a todo el público. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
URL:https://montclairlocal.news/event/festival-de-los-andes/
LOCATION:AMPHITHEATER MONTCLAIR STATE UNIVERSITY\, 1 Normal Avenue\, Montclair\, 070743\, United States
CATEGORIES:Art & Culture
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://montclairlocal.news/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Festival-de-los-Andes-flyer-SPAN.png
END:VEVENT
