SUMMARY:2026 Camp for a Day: Live Music\, Beer Garden\, Fun Foods\, and more for 21+
DESCRIPTION:🎉 Camp for a Day is BACK! 🎉\nMark your calendars for Saturday\, September 26th and join us for an unforgettable afternoon of food\, drinks\, live music\, games\, and adventure—all while supporting an incredible cause!\n🌟 NEW THIS YEAR:\n🍷 Wine has been added to the menu!\n⏰ We’ve extended the event by one extra hour (3 PM–8 PM)!\n🍺 Beer\, wine\, and cider can now be enjoyed anywhere on the property while you explore camp.\nPlus\, enjoy all of your favorites:\n🎶 Live Music\n🍔 Fun Foods\n🍺 Beer Garden\n🏹 Archery\n🪓 Hatchet Throwing\n🚜 Pedal Go-Karts\n⛳ Mini Golf\n🏐 Volleyball\n🏀 Basketball\n🎯 Lawn Games\n⚡ 450-Foot Dueling Ziplines\n…and so much more!\n❤️ 100% of proceeds benefit The Eagle Foundation\, helping send children to summer camp who otherwise wouldn’t have the opportunity.\n🎟️ Tickets are on sale NOW!\n💲 $40 Admission\n📍 74 Davidson Mill Road\, North Brunswick\, NJ\n🗓️ Saturday\, September 26 | 3:00–8:00 PM\n👥 21+ Event\nGather your friends\, relive your favorite camp memories\, and help us make a difference—one camper at a time! \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
