SUMMARY:Northeast Earth Coalition Fall Harvest Fiesta: Celebrating 10 Years of Environmental Work
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate 10 years of Community Work with NEEC at our 2nd annual Fall Harvest Fiesta. \nThe evening will feature delicious Mexican food by Mezoco\, live music by the Jonathan Luks Trio\, and a silent auction featuring fabulous trips\, framed art\, garden consultations\, gift certificates to local businesses\, and more. \nYour ticket purchase will help to provide essential support for NEEC’s core programs\, including our community vegetable gardens\, our wildlife habitat projects\, our Free Little Pantry food aid program\, and our environnmental education initiatives. \nJoin us for a night to remember! \nThank you to our Sponsors:\nPartners for Health\nMulvey Custom Contracting\nGlen Ridge Congregational Church\nThe Board of the Bloomfield Cemetery\nTechRunners \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
