SUMMARY:Fall Festival
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the season at the South Orange Downtown Fall Festival on Sunday\, September 27 from 11 AM–1 PM at Spiotta Park\, 20–32 Village Plaza in South Orange. This free\, family-friendly event features pumpkin decorating\, seasonal crafts\, games\, face painting\, story time and hands-on activities hosted by local businesses including Oh! Canary\, Artistry by Ampy Salon\, Cute As New\, The Art Boutique and the South Orange Public Library. Special thanks to Pumpkin Patch Sponsor The Lichtman Rabney Group of Prominent Properties Sotheby’s International Realty for helping make this event possible. Learn more at southorangedowntown.org \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
