SUMMARY:Great Big Beautiful Art Sale
DESCRIPTION:About the Exhibit\nOnce a year\, we pull out all the stops for our WAE Studio Artists by dedicating the entire Heidi Gallery to the extraordinary range of work created across all three art studios. \nFeatured Artwork\nThe gallery will be packed with paintings\, collages\, digital art\, photography\, and mixed media creations! Vibrant colors\, rich textures\, bold creative expression… dive headfirst into the world of WAE creativity. \nSales and Support\nAll artwork will be available for purchase\, with every sale benefiting both the individual artists and WAE Center programs. This year\, all pieces will be priced under $300\, with many unframed and unstretched works offered at especially accessible prices. \nSale & Exhibit Dates:\nSale Starts Monday\, August 24th\, 2026!\nHeidi gallery is open Monday – Friday 9:30am to 4:30pm or by appointment. \nGreat Big Fabulous ART Sale Day\nSunday\, September 27\, 2026 from 2pm – 4pm \nCome and meet the artists\, see hundreds of pieces of art and find the ones that speak to you \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
