SUMMARY:Atlantic City (Harrah's) Day Trip with South End Gardens Tenants Association
DESCRIPTION:The South End Gardens Tenants Association is hosting a day trip to Harrah’s Resort Atlantic City on Monday\, September 28\, 2026. Round-trip motorcoach transportation will depart directly from South End Gardens in Montclair\, New Jersey\, providing a direct and comfortable ride to the Marina District. Tickets are priced at $50 per person\, which covers charter bus transit along with a $20 casino slot play voucher provided by Harrah’s upon arrival. During the visit\, attendees will have full access to the expansive gaming floor\, including thousands of slot machines\, table games\, and the Caesars Sportsbook. Guests can also enjoy a wide range of dining options—from casual meals at Gordon Ramsay Steak and Coastal Craft Kitchen to quick-service dining in the food court—or relax near the resort’s signature glass-domed pool area before the evening return trip to Montclair. To reserve a seat or obtain more details\, participants can register online at SouthEndTenants.com or call 347-509-6582 (voicemail/call back). Credit/Debit/ACH Limited Remaining Seats/Act Fast \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
